  "description": "NURVIJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H80 Cl8 Gd4 O14,3(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 4 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.568-4.002 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.36-116.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [{(thf)2Cl2Gd(μ-Cl)2(μ3-O2)Gd(thf)3}2]·3thf.",
